    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just keep thinking about how it's always been so perfect. up until now. if i could just... stay in that version of myself. if i don't have a way to fix this, then i'm just going to spend the next fifty years watching them realize i'm not who they thought i was. i hate the idea of being a burden that lingers. wouldn't it be easier if the story just ended while it still meant something, instead of dragging it out until i'm just a shadow of what i used to be?",
